家？","C":"你把牛奶放到哪儿了？","D":"上次去海边的时候，你拍照了吗？","E":"花园里的花现在开了吗？"}},"HSK3-C02-R-V1":{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-V1","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"晚点","B":"海","C":"层","D":"环境","E":"一直","F":"搬"}},"HSK3-C02-R-V2":{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-V2","type":"wordPool","options":{"A":"关","B":"咱们","C":"换","D":"满意","E":"马","F":"卫生间"}},"HSK3-C02-R-T57":{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-T57","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"小方以前住在学校旁边，上学很方便。可是家里人来了以后，原来的房子太小，住不下。她看了两个小区，第一个的房子便宜，但是离车站太远。她最后选了第二个，新家有三个房间，小区门口还能坐车去学校。"},"HSK3-C02-R-T59":{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-T59","type":"sharedPassage","passage":"这次去海边，我原来想和弟弟一起坐飞机。买票的时候，弟弟发现坐高铁也能到，车站离我们家还很近。我们就改坐高铁。下车以后，本来要直接去宾馆，后来看到车站旁边有家小店，大家都饿了，就先在那里吃了饭。"}},"examples":{"EM":{"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M1","prompt":"你觉得这家宾馆的房间怎么样？","answer":"C"},"EV1":{"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V1","prompt":"这个小区的（　）挺好，晚上也很安静。","answer":"D"},"EV2":{"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V2","prompt":"甲：你会骑（　）吗？／乙：不会，下次想学一学。","answer":"E"},"E3":{"passage":"我早上八点半才到学校，同学们已经去球场了。我把书包放在教室里，就过去找他们。","question":"他把书包放哪儿了？","options":{"A":"教室里","B":"球场上","C":"家里"},"answer":"A"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-31","number":31,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M1","prompt":"请问王老师住几楼？","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-32","number":32,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M1","prompt":"房间里有点儿热，要开空调吗？","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-33","number":33,"lesson":4,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M1","prompt":"这次放假我想去你们那儿玩几天。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-34","number":34,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M1","prompt":"这间晚上太吵了，我能换一间吗？","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-35","number":35,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M1","prompt":"你拿着银行卡准备去哪儿？","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-36","number":36,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M2","prompt":"在冰箱第二层，要喝的话你自己拿。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-37","number":37,"lesson":4,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M2","prompt":"拍了几张，可是天不太好，没拍清楚。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-38","number":38,"lesson":4,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M2","prompt":"比原来晚了半小时，晚上八点才到。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-39","number":39,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M2","prompt":"开了，楼下那几棵树上都是花。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-40","number":40,"lesson":3,"type":"sentenceMatch","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-M2","prompt":"我想住得离公司近一点儿。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-41","number":41,"lesson":4,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V1","prompt":"飞机（　）了，我们还要在这里多等四十分钟。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-42","number":42,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V1","prompt":"那张桌子太重，需要两个人一起（　）。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-43","number":43,"lesson":4,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V1","prompt":"宾馆的窗户很大，从房间里就能看见（　）。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-44","number":44,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V1","prompt":"我家在这座楼的第十（　），请坐电梯上来。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-45","number":45,"lesson":4,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V1","prompt":"从上初中到现在，我（　）住在这儿。","answer":"E"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-46","number":46,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V2","prompt":"甲：这个房间里的灯怎么还亮着？／乙：我忘了（　），现在就去。","answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-47","number":47,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V2","prompt":"甲：这双鞋有点儿小。／乙：那给你（　）一双大的吧。","answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-48","number":48,"lesson":4,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V2","prompt":"甲：家里人喜欢那个宾馆吗？／乙：都很（　），他们说下次还住那儿。","answer":"D"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-49","number":49,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V2","prompt":"甲：你把洗衣机放哪儿了？／乙：还在（　）门边，请你帮我往里搬一点儿。","answer":"F"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-50","number":50,"lesson":3,"type":"wordBank","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-V2","prompt":"甲：外面好像不下雨了。／乙：那（　）出去走走吧。","answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-51","number":51,"lesson":3,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"新房子的窗边有一张小桌子和两把椅子。以前我常在床边看书。搬来以后，下午有太阳的时候，我就坐在窗边看书。","question":"他现在常在哪儿看书？","options":{"A":"办公室里","B":"窗边","C":"公园里"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-52","number":52,"lesson":4,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"我昨天订了早上八点到海边的车。今天早上司机说路上风很大，要到十点以后才能走。我打算在宾馆再等一会儿。","question":"他原来打算几点出发？","options":{"A":"十点","B":"八点","C":"十二点"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-53","number":53,"lesson":3,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"我们新家附近有个小市场，买菜很方便。小区里也有个小花园，不过现在还不能进去，要等下个月才开门。","question":"那个花园：","options":{"A":"现在不能进","B":"离小区很远","C":"只能晚上去"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-54","number":54,"lesson":4,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"这家宾馆前面是大街，后面是山。我选了后面那间房，虽然小一点儿，但是开着窗也听不到街上的车声。","question":"他为什么选后面的房间？","options":{"A":"离街更近","B":"房间更安静","C":"房间更大"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-55","number":55,"lesson":3,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"爸爸今天没去银行。他想办一张新卡，昨天才发现周日不开门，所以准备明天下班以后再去办。","question":"爸爸今天为什么没去？","options":{"A":"银行卡丢了","B":"下班太晚","C":"银行不开门"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-56","number":56,"lesson":4,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"passage":"第一次学骑马的时候，我很害怕。老师让我先站在旁边看，后来又牵着马陪我走了一小段，我才放心。","question":"谁陪他骑了一小段？","options":{"A":"朋友","B":"妈妈","C":"老师"},"answer":"C"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-57","number":57,"lesson":3,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-T57","question":"小方为什么搬家？","options":{"A":"原来的房子太小","B":"原来的小区太吵","C":"她换学校了"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-58","number":58,"lesson":3,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-T57","question":"关于她的新住处，可以知道：","options":{"A":"房子有三个房间","B":"比另一个更便宜","C":"只能走路去学校"},"answer":"A"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-59","number":59,"lesson":4,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-T59","question":"他们最后怎么去海边？","options":{"A":"坐公共汽车","B":"坐高铁","C":"坐飞机"},"answer":"B"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-R-60","number":60,"lesson":4,"type":"passageChoice","points":1,"materialId":"HSK3-C02-R-T59","question":"他们下车以后先做了什么？","options":{"A":"去海边照相","B":"去宾馆放行李","C":"去小店吃饭"},"answer":"C"}]},"writing":{"examples":{"pinyinCharacter":{"prompt":"请把你的东西（　）在这儿。","pinyin":"fàng","answer":"放"},"pictureSentence":{"word":"看书","image":"assets/images/w-example.jpg","answer":"小男孩正在看书。"}},"items":[{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-61","number":61,"lesson":3,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"那双鞋太小了，我想（　）一双大的。","pinyin":"huàn","answer":"换","reference":"那双鞋太小了，我想换一双大的。"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-62","number":62,"lesson":3,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"小周家住在这座楼的第九（　）。","pinyin":"céng","answer":"层","reference":"小周家住在这座楼的第九层。"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-63","number":63,"lesson":4,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"这家宾馆的房间打扫得很干（　）。","pinyin":"jìng","answer":"净","reference":"这家宾馆的房间打扫得很干净。"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-64","number":64,"lesson":3,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"这个小（　）离我上班的地方不远。","pinyin":"qū","answer":"区","reference":"这个小区离我上班的地方不远。"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-65","number":65,"lesson":4,"type":"pinyinCharacter","points":1,"prompt":"从宾馆走几分钟，就能看到大（　）了。","pinyin":"hǎi","answer":"海","reference":"从宾馆走几分钟，就能看到大海了。"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-66","number":66,"lesson":3,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"洗衣机","image":"assets/images/c02-w-66.jpg","reference":"她从洗衣机里拿出洗好的毛巾。"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-67","number":67,"lesson":3,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"搬家","image":"assets/images/c02-w-67.jpg","reference":"他们刚搬家，正把箱子一个个打开。"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-68","number":68,"lesson":3,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"花园","image":"assets/images/c02-w-68.jpg","reference":"老人正在小区花园里给花浇水。"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-69","number":69,"lesson":4,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"骑马","image":"assets/images/c02-w-69.jpg","reference":"小朋友在学骑马。"},{"id":"HSK3-C02-W-70","number":70,"lesson":4,"type":"pictureSentence","points":2,"word":"相机","image":"assets/images/c02-w-70.jpg","reference":"他在河边用相机拍照。"}]},"